Title: Kañe Flood This

INT. AN OFFICE IN THE GENERALITAT VALENCIANA

KAÑE, the president of the Generalitat Valenciana, stands at the window, looking out over the city, holding his phone while taking a selfie. JOANROBERTO, his advisor, storms in, holding a shovel, his boots covered in mud.

JOANROBERTO
(urgently)
Don Kañe! The south of València is flooded. Paiporta is submerged under 2 meters of water. We need to call for the Military Emergencies Unit right now.

KAÑE
(looking at his phone, unimpressed)
GOOD MORNING RETARDS.

JOANROBERTO
(pauses, confused)
What? No, listen—we have people trapped in buildings. The roads are washed out, and we need—

KAÑE
(interrupting)
I GIVE ORDERS I DONT TAKE ADVICE.

JOANROBERTO
OK then order the emergency services to go there. We don’t have enough hands.

KAÑE
(shakes head)
WHY DO BROKE NIGGAS TELL ME WHAT TO DO BUT I NEVER TELL THEM NIGGAS WHAT TO DO? IS THERE SOMETHING ABOUT BEING BROKE THAT MAKES THEM FEEL POWERFUL?

JOANROBERTO
Don Kañe, you are the president of the Generalitat Valenciana, you're responsible for dealing with natural disasters. There are people drowning!

KAÑE
I DON’T GIVE A FUCK HOW MANY PEOPLE YOU KILLED OR IF YOU WENT TO JAIL. GOING TO JAIL IS A VERY ACHIEVABLE GOAL.

JOANROBERTO
Hopefully nobody is going to jail for this, don Kañe.
(pause)
But you're going to have to explain where the hell you were when the meteorologists and the hydrologists sounded the alarm.

KAÑE
SOMETIMES YOUR GREATEST LIABILITY IS THE WOMEN YOU LOVE

JOANROBERTO
Sure... If we act now we might still be in time to save many people and hopefully nobody will be going to jail. Can you ask the national government to intervene?

KAÑE
IM NOT GONNA DO ALL THIS WORK TO SAY WHAT THE FUCK I WANT AND THEN NOT SAY WHAT THE FUCK I WANT

JOANROBERTO
But we don't have enough resources to deal with this emergency! We have thousands of volunteers waiting for buses in the city of arts and sciences. Can you...

KAÑE
(interrupting)
IF YOU SEE ANYONE AROUND ME KNOW THAT THEY ARE PROVIDING A SERVICE   FRIENDS ARE FOR KIDS

JOANROBERTO
(pointing at a map)
OK I believe that if we send three buses of volunteers to Paiporta and Catarroja we will cover many of the most severely affected areas in this perimeter, can you call the dispatcher at the bus station?

KAÑE
SIMPLE RULE: I ONLY TALK TO PEOPLE WHO LISTEN.

JOANROBERTO
Can you call the dispatcher?

KAÑE
I SAY WHATEVER THE FUCK I WANT PUSSIES.

JOANROBERTO
Don Kañe, people are drowning *as we speak*!

KAÑE
YOU STUPID ASS WOKE PAWNS. I HAVE NO RESPECT OR EMPATHY FOR ANYONE LIVING CAUSE NO ONE LIVING CAN FUCK WITH ME.

JOANROBERTO
(taking a call)
The red cross is asking if there is a designated drop-off point for donated food and water, or if we should set one up?

KAÑE
NO BODY CAN DO ANYTHING ABOUT ANYTHING     NO ONE CAN TELL ME WHAT TO DO    EVERYONE TELLS YOU WHAT TO DO     IM NOT HERE TO RELATE OR GET PEOPLE TO AGREE

JOANROBERTO
Can you please focus. People are panicking because of conflicting information—can we establish a single point of contact for official updates.

KAÑE
i love hitler. now what bitches. let's see if y'all give that money back. im a nazi. i say whatever the fuck i want pussies

JOANROBERTO
Honestly?

KAÑE
HONESTY IS THE STRONGEST FORM OF ENERGY        EXCEPT FOR WHEN ITS TIME TO LIE TO YOUR BITCH

JOANROBERTO
Don Kañe, please think of the children. Think of the families who lost everything. Aren't you forgetting what we as valencian government officials stand for? Aren't you forgetting the responsibility that we...?

KAÑE
(interrupting)
I FORGOT TO SAY RETARD
THAT WAS RETARDED OF ME

JOANROBERTO
Don Kañe, what the hell are you trying to do?

KAÑE
I AM NOT TRYING TO BE THE VOICE OF BLACK PEOPLE THAT WAS OBAMAS JOB         IM GETTING MONEY AND TALKING SHIT ON TWITTER    IM EXPRESSING WHAT IVE WENT THROUGH AND THINGS I CARE ABOUT

JOANROBERTO
Why are you doing this? Do you realise lives are at stake?

KAÑE
PARDON ME   I MEANT FUUUCK EVERYBODY    KEEP BROKE OPINIONS TO A MINIMUM LIKE YOUR BANK ACCOUNT

JOANROBERTO
You’re a disgrace.

KAÑE
I TURNED DOWN THREE PHOTOS THIS WEEK
WITH MAKE A WISH KIDS IN WHEELCHAIRS.

JOANROBERTO
(shakes his head, disgusted)
I’m done.

KAÑE
CALL ME YAYDOLF YITLER AND YOUR BITCH STILL WANTS TO FUCK

JOANROBERTO
Fuck this job! I'm going to ask to be transferred to a desk in the ayuntamiento.

KAÑE
YOOOOO KNOW ONE HAS QUIT SO FAR AND I HAVE A LOT OF GAY PEOPLE THAT WORK FOR ME AND A LOT OF JEWS AND A COUPLE GAY JEWS THAT HAVENT REACHED THEIR FULL GAY JEW POTENTIAL IF THEYRE STILL WORKING FOR A ME

JOANROBERTO
(leaving)
You're gonna go down in history as the most disastrously negligent valencian president.

JOANROBERTO storms off. KAÑE is still glued to his phone.

KAÑE
(to himself)
I’M LETTING EVERYTHING OUT BUT MY TEARS.

JOANROBERTO
How did we ever vote for this?!

KAÑE
YOU NIGGAS SLOW

CUT TO BLACK.